---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import officialSEP from '../../assets/images/official-sep.webp';

import LogoRVOE from '../../assets/images/logo-rvoe.svg';
import LogoSEP from '../../assets/images/logo-sep.svg';

import { SquareArrowOutUpRight } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="flex flex-col lg:min-h-10 lg:flex-row">
    <div
    class="relative isolate flex flex-col gap-10 p-10 bg-yellow text-black
          transition-colors duration-500 ease-in-out
         has-[a:hover]:text-white overflow-hidden lg:w-3/5"
    >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
            <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,64px)] font-heading leading-tight uppercase">
                Validez oficial ante la SEP
            </h2>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 font-sans text-sm md:text-2xl md:pr-25">
                <p>El RVOE es la autorización oficial de la SEP que garantiza que al graduarte en INUE obtendrás tu título con validez oficial, sin importar la modalidad que elijas.</p>
                <p>Estudia con la tranquilidad de que cada hora de esfuerzo se convierte en un título que el mundo reconoce.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-6">
            <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-6 h-15">
                <LogoRVOE class="h-10 md:h-15 w-auto" aria-label="Logo RVOE" role="img" />
                <LogoSEP class="h-10 md:h-15 w-auto" aria-label="Logo SEP" role="img" />
            </div>

            <a
            href="#"
            class="group relative ml-auto inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-full
                   border border-black bg-black px-6 py-4
                   font-heading text-base text-yellow uppercase"
            >
                Verificar RVOE
                <SquareArrowOutUpRight aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 stroke-[1.7px]" />
                <span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -z-10
                           size-[200vmax] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2
                           scale-0 rounded-full bg-black
                           transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out
                           group-hover:scale-100 motion-reduce:transition-none"
                ></span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative lg:w-2/5">
        <Image
            src={officialSEP}
            alt="RVOE oficial de la SEP"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-auto w-full lg:absolute lg:inset-0 lg:h-full lg:object-cover lg:object-center"
        />
    </div>
</section>